Package: homelab-sso-ui
Architecture: all
Depends: perl (>= 5.36),
         libmojolicious-perl,
         libyaml-libyaml-perl
Description: SSO login service for Homelab services
 A small Mojolicious application implementing an OAuth2 authorization-code
 flow (/oauth/authorize, /oauth/token, /oauth/userinfo) as a thin wrapper
 around homelab-api's existing login/JWT machinery. Lets other services
 (Roundcube, homelab-drive-web-ui) delegate login to a single identity
 provider instead of checking credentials themselves.
